      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Chapter 635 of the Laws of 1964 authorized the Board of Education to adopt a resolution amending the provisions governing the Board of Education Retire-nt System to the extent necessary to put into effect a pension-providing-for-creased-take-home-pay plan analogous to that authorized by Chapter 517 of the Laws of 1963 which resolution shall not take effect until and unless it is approved by the Mayor of the City of New York; and",
